{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120570","id":3917864044,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7phdxs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120570","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120570.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120570.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120570","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120570/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120570/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120570/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ab4fc7c9b536e059840162e94672483da7eee7c8","number":120570,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add option to remove empty root nodes on scene import","user":{"login":"Shaderd00d","id":9315812,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTU4MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9315812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d","html_url":"https://github.com/Shaderd00d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15014\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n**Problem:**\r\nImporting 3D models (e.g., characters or meshes from Blender) often generates intermediate `Node3D`s above the actual `Skeleton3D` or `MeshInstance3D`. This might create unwanted hierarchy and prevents i.e. the skeleton from being the true scene root.\r\n\r\n**Solution:**\r\nThis PR adds a new boolean import option `nodes/remove_empty_root` which is only visible when \"Import As: Scene\" is selected. \r\n\r\nIf enabled, the importer will:\r\n- Descend through empty intermediate `Node3D`s, provided there is exactly one 3D child path.\r\n- Promote the first substantive 3D child (e.g., `Skeleton3D` or `MeshInstance3D`) to be the new scene root.\r\n- Safely reparent any child nodes that do not inherit from `Node3D` (such as `AnimationPlayer`) to the new root.\r\n- Automatically retarget `AnimationPlayer` track paths to reflect the modified hierarchy.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c86cf53-08aa-4900-8022-04b4ff42a02b\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://ap